WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.742
Buying property in Ontario is a lot. Titled makes it simple.

00:00:04.942 --> 00:00:09.186
A house, a condo, or land. On your own, or with people you trust.

00:00:10.236 --> 00:00:13.675
Every listing comes straight from REALTOR.ca, live.

00:00:13.876 --> 00:00:19.821
And on each one, you’ll see the price split between your buyers, what it could rent for, and the monthly mortgage.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.830
So, does it make money each month, or cost you money?

00:00:24.031 --> 00:00:31.582
We take the rent it could bring in, then subtract the mortgage, property tax, insurance, repairs, and a little for empty months.

00:00:31.782 --> 00:00:37.902
What’s left is your monthly cash flow. Above zero, the home pays you. Below zero, you pay in.

00:00:38.952 --> 00:00:40.340
Then, pick your group.

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:43.815
Invite family or friends, up to 49 of them.

00:00:44.014 --> 00:00:49.039
Everyone gets their own share, and sees exactly what they’ll pay before anyone commits.

00:00:50.089 --> 00:00:54.681
When you’re ready, our registered agent makes the offer, and negotiates for you.

00:00:54.882 --> 00:00:57.178
And a real estate lawyer checks the title.

00:00:58.228 --> 00:00:59.331
Need a mortgage?

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:05.695
Our licensed partner shops the big banks, credit unions, and private lenders, whatever your credit score.

00:01:06.745 --> 00:01:10.641
On closing day, everyone goes on title with their own percentage.

00:01:10.841 --> 00:01:14.148
Live in it, rent it out, or sell your share down the road.

00:01:15.198 --> 00:01:19.681
One flat fee. $999, split between you.

00:01:19.881 --> 00:01:20.948
That’s Titled.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.186
Own it together.
